{
    "title": "DDS 2 GO",
    "description": "Manage your DDS Account conveniently and securely with the DDS 2 GO Mobile Services App for Georgia based driver\u2019s license accounts.\r\n\r\n\r\n* You must already have an existing email address and password setup with our Online Services website to access the DDS 2 GO Mobile App.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccess Your Account\r\n\u2022 Login is secure with 2 step-verification.\r\n\u2022 Set up biometric sign-in to securely sign in to the app instead of using your password.\r\n\r\n\r\nView Account Information\r\n\u2022 License Status\r\n\u2022 Real ID Status\r\n\u2022 Address on License\r\n\u2022 Existing Fees\r\n\u2022 Points\r\n\u2022 License Details\r\n\u2022 CDL License Details\r\n\u2022 License Permit Details\r\n\u2022 ID Details\r\n\r\n\r\nView and Pay\r\n\u2022 License Reinstatement\r\n\u2022 Super Speeder\r\n\u2022 Suspensions\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\u2022 Make a Road Test Appointment.\r\n\u2022 Complete the DS23 License Application prior to visiting a center.\r\n\u2022 Verify and print a Driver Training and/or Risk Reduction Certificate.\r\n\u2022 ADAP Free 3-year MVR for Parent.\r\n\u2022 View Order Status and Order History.\r\n\r\n\r\nOther Features\r\n\u2022 The user will receive notifications and alerts concerning their driving record.\r\n\u2022 The user will receive DDS alerts concerning closings, etc.\r\n\u2022 Drivers will be able to view 2 years of their driving history in the Mobile App for free. \r\n\u2022 The user can locate their nearest Customer Service Center.\r\n\u2022 The user can view the Drivers Manual.\r\n\u2022 Teen Drivers can take the Practice exam for the Driver\u2019s Test.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour mobile carrier\u2019s message and data rates may apply.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manage your DDS Account conveniently and securely with the DDS 2 GO Mobile Services App for Georgia based driver\u2019s license accounts.<br><br><br>* You must already have an existing email address and password setup with our Online Services website to access the DDS 2 GO Mobile App.<br><br><br>Access Your Account<br>\u2022 Login is secure with 2 step-verification.<br>\u2022 Set up biometric sign-in to securely sign in to the app instead of using your password.<br><br><br>View Account Information<br>\u2022 License Status<br>\u2022 Real ID Status<br>\u2022 Address on License<br>\u2022 Existing Fees<br>\u2022 Points<br>\u2022 License Details<br>\u2022 CDL License Details<br>\u2022 License Permit Details<br>\u2022 ID Details<br><br><br>View and Pay<br>\u2022 License Reinstatement<br>\u2022 Super Speeder<br>\u2022 Suspensions<br><br><br>Services<br>\u2022 Make a Road Test Appointment.<br>\u2022 Complete the DS23 License Application prior to visiting a center.<br>\u2022 Verify and print a Driver Training and/or Risk Reduction Certificate.<br>\u2022 ADAP Free 3-year MVR for Parent.<br>\u2022 View Order Status and Order History.<br><br><br>Other Features<br>\u2022 The user will receive notifications and alerts concerning their driving record.<br>\u2022 The user will receive DDS alerts concerning closings, etc.<br>\u2022 Drivers will be able to view 2 years of their driving history in the Mobile App for free. <br>\u2022 The user can locate their nearest Customer Service Center.<br>\u2022 The user can view the Drivers Manual.<br>\u2022 Teen Drivers can take the Practice exam for the Driver\u2019s Test.<br><br><br>Your mobile carrier\u2019s message and data rates may apply.",
